{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"p9_01_mag_load","model_identifier":"","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{},"ai_used":true,"ai_agents":"claude-code","afl_rig":{"version":2,"repo":"D:/Minecraft Modding/Apocalypse First Light","slim":false,"view_pitch":0,"first_person":false,"crouch":false,"breathing":false,"rifle":false,"props":[{"id":"p9_01_magazine","group":"prop_p9_01_magazine","scale":0.49467,"D":[2.04264,9.54264,-4.07608],"hold":"grip","frame":"chest","items":["p9_01_magazine","p9_01_extended_magazine"],"symmetry":null,"open_block":null,"about":"The P9-01 magazine in the hand while it is loaded (gun/p9_01_mag_load; docs/native_guns/magazine_system_v1.md 4): the held magazine item as NativeMagazineRendering draws it, straightened (item block units: the magazine pivot at (0.5, 0.635, 0.5), the lips up, the front at -z). Scale as the P9-01 prop, so it is the gun's own magazine size. Points from tools/build-p9-01-magazine.mjs's straightened mesh: top (the feed lips, where a round is pressed in), grip (the middle of the body), base (the floorplate), hold_l (the left palm on the magazine's left side, low: the palm is 2 px off a 4 px hand's middle, so it rests on the side instead of swallowing the magazine). The extended magazine is held at the same points."},{"id":"9x19mm_round","group":"prop_9x19mm_round","scale":0.49467,"D":[2.04264,11.62659,-5.4572],"hold":"pinch","frame":"bone:pelvis","items":["9x19mm_round"],"symmetry":null,"open_block":null,"about":"A loose 9x19 mm round in the fingers while a magazine is loaded (gun/p9_01_mag_load; docs/native_guns/magazine_system_v1.md 4): the round item as client/AflStaticMeshItemClient draws it (upright, base at y 0.451463, centred on x / z), at the P9-01 prop's scale so it matches the magazine. Points: base, mid, tip, and pinch: where the right hand's palm is while it holds the round (1.7 px behind the base along the round, 1.5 px off it on +z), so the round shows past the fingertips (the palm is 1.5 px short of the hand's end, skeleton/GunStance#PALM_Y)."}]},"resolution":{"width":16,"height":16},"elements":[{"name":"skin_chest","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4,18,-2],"to":[4,24,2],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,18,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"east":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"south":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"west":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"up":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"down":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]}},"type":"cube","uuid":"a6ff8e93-37ec-2ffc-c235-3c76e662fa57"},{"name":"skin_pelvis","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4,12,-2],"to":[4,18,2],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,12,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"east":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"south":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"west":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"up":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"down":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]}},"type":"cube","uuid":"9262f1dc-5f5a-5176-5dc2-129ecc071992"},{"name":"skin_upper_arm_r","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[4,18,-2],"to":[8,24,2],"autouv":0,"color":3,"origin":[5,22,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"east":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"south":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"west":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"up":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"down":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]}},"type":"cube","uuid":"15b04fab-76a8-8170-93e6-ad119c37230c"},{"name":"skin_forearm_r","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[4,14,-2],"to":[8,18,2],"autouv":0,"color":2,"origin":[5,18,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"east":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"south":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"west":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"up":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]},"down":{"uv":[0,0,1,1]}},"type":"cube","uuid":"c8fad743-42ae-d372-2941-7e5795f40eae"},{"name":"skin_hand_r","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"exp